<div class="key-takeaways"><h2>Key takeaways</h2><ul>
<li>San Marcos sits on the Balcones Escarpment in "Flash Flood Alley," and NOAA lists 127 flash flood reports for Hays County.</li>
<li>During the Memorial Day 2015 flood, the Blanco River at Wimberley rose from about 5 feet to about 41 feet in roughly four hours.</li>
<li>Standard homeowners and commercial policies generally exclude flood; NFIP or private flood policies fill that gap.</li>
